{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"tost2i72mlhrozn21k59k3w","title":"Thinkpads","desc":"","updated":1711461284896,"created":1711460969698,"custom":{},"fname":"tech.thinkpads","type":"note","vault":{"name":"main","fsPath":"main","useFMTitle":false},"contentHash":"8582cf0005cd89c7623d67521842843d","links":[],"anchors":{"thinkpads":{"type":"header","text":"ThinkPads","value":"thinkpads","line":8,"column":0,"depth":1},"panel-self-refresh-causing-mouse-stuttering-in-amd-thinkpads":{"type":"header","text":"Panel Self Refresh Causing Mouse Stuttering in AMD ThinkPads","value":"panel-self-refresh-causing-mouse-stuttering-in-amd-thinkpads","line":10,"column":0,"depth":2},"amd-thinkpads--thinkbooks-artificially-hiked-cpu-clocks":{"type":"header","text":"AMD ThinkPads / ThinkBooks Artificially Hiked CPU Clocks","value":"amd-thinkpads--thinkbooks-artificially-hiked-cpu-clocks","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"fb9e4130-eaf8-425d-9039-5bc2ee876f18","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"thinkpads\">ThinkPads<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#thinkpads\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"panel-self-refresh-causing-mouse-stuttering-in-amd-thinkpads\">Panel Self Refresh Causing Mouse Stuttering in AMD ThinkPads<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#panel-self-refresh-causing-mouse-stuttering-in-amd-thinkpads\"></a></h2>\n<p>Only seems to affect Windows 11 (and probably linux where PSR is enabled).</p>\n<p>For Windows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <code>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Class\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\0000</code></li>\n<li>Set <code>DalPSRFeatureEnable</code> to <code>0</code></li>\n<li>Reboot</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://forums.lenovo.com/t5/ThinkPad-T400-T500-and-newer-T-series-Laptops/T14s-Gen4-AMD-Display-driver-lag-mouse-cursor-stuttering-YouTube-dropping-frames/m-p/5278032?page=4#6286098\">Source Lenovo forum thread</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"amd-thinkpads--thinkbooks-artificially-hiked-cpu-clocks\">AMD ThinkPads / ThinkBooks Artificially Hiked CPU Clocks<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#amd-thinkpads--thinkbooks-artificially-hiked-cpu-clocks\"></a></h2>\n<p>Seems to be caused by buggy AMD chipset drivers, <a href=\"https://forums.lenovo.com/t5/ThinkBook-Laptops/Battery-drain-after-last-batch-of-updates/m-p/5242788?page=2#6127963\">fixed in some models by Lenovo</a></p>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"root","desc":"","updated":1622102326440,"created":1595961348801,"custom":{"stub":false,"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"name":"main","fsPath":"main","useFMTitle":false},"contentHash":"2222728f026e86e75d06a6048c4f43ed","links":[],"anchors":{"personal-knowledge-base":{"type":"header","text":"Personal Knowledge Base","value":"personal-knowledge-base","line":8,"column":0,"depth":1}},"children":["9fa47ef8-a44b-4e36-929f-4aa7835b474d","6e43ea37-b3e7-44cf-aac7-31ae947d32a2","a10a1802-11d0-4557-a374-89712109cf90","0b9beaed-19ee-4124-a880-07e520da2b17","ddf3e9b2-ea12-4129-8785-06d6b82d4fcb","ayddclvdd132ijypjxgea7l","msjts3od3aa2efikax5nno7","25n1c553lqko8il7bxy601k","k1etmmjl06zhj11wx4ipt76","b4be93a8-69e3-4427-b4cd-53593c3ab387","5bbec2d1-4abe-4a2a-8bc5-5f3d4e229766","4a064a97-3d2d-4429-9a08-5b158dc7ef35","543e830d-feac-4048-8075-58c406bc1105","8875d2cf-85f8-41e8-b16d-c3707e40d74e","4k2ot7nwcxbum3rwhovp8bp","8ec37b11-59ad-4ea8-82d9-3186e7e0cd29","dOehc8Yap1zIbEqLvQvOt","i0g2e5s84q33i4o88s0zzcb","b58269ed-9a0e-4213-b5b0-6d59c81d9899","b4fc6d48-17ae-4764-acdb-ec0f52707860","091b67bf-8bfa-454c-bbd3-7d84d8216229","f6fbee87-be27-471c-99bd-4af45d6a3156","fb9e4130-eaf8-425d-9039-5bc2ee876f18","4fb536a9-c146-4df3-8f30-9b2fb52a77f7","a61859ll9tjxd1qy35abccs","2gwv1pb5b0fmp3v55ge33xq","zh34gct4uodsqcszro274hb","21ef758d-ca84-4be0-8eed-5e95ab3b4a7e","5fb5baa9-8b3d-4044-9c03-bbabfbdfe78a","2f6af89e-df82-4144-87fc-a2be66a0e657","wy23hkmakngujlepw9j96ea","POgyWcSIqi29tpqfP5uyS","525uy1b41n5r1x0n5oi